{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fair warning(s):</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will contain flashing lights. If you are photosensitive, please don't play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has a lot of gore and foul language, don't play it if you are <span class=\"bb_strike\">a wussy</span>\u00a0uncomfortable with the material. I do not wish that this game is the blame for a mass killing</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retired supersoldier, titularly named Fred Fuches, witnesses most of his family being brutalized by the government and goes on a rampage against the same government</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What am I supposed to do?\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to purge the government in other places, although more than them are attacking you. Enemies may come in waves in some areas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A &quot;brutality&quot; system where you can obliterate your foes (Violent)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sensless violence against innocent people (if you choose)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorials (yay)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of running and jumping (platforming)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fast-paced gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranking system (Doesn't unlock important stuff)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of weapons (27, to be exact)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884740?t=1772583909","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884740?t=1772583909","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884740/6bfa5e04a281878c57b79d80c520f3a9321c4cc1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772583909","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea